  "id": "c3f534e6-5b44-425b-8631-da8129688e82",
  "title": "Incineration Pyromancer Raid Build",
  "description": "[overview]\nmy current pyro dps raid profile which doesn't use any of the last three talent nodes because i think they are not that good\n\n[talents]\nyou can swap 1 explosive point for Rapid Incineration to get more Lava Shards which results in getting more ember stacks but idk its lowkey not good\n\n[rotation]\nGet 5 ember stacks before pull\n\nOn pull cast Ignite -> Blaze -> Lava Shard \n\nNow if your tank is not good at keeping threat at the start just keep spamming Flare Bolt or a Meteor untill he builds up some threat . if he is good on threat start Blasting\n\nPop Fired Up! and Eruption and your trinkets . Start spamming Explode\nkeep an eye out for your ember stacks . if its getting lower than 3 stacks cast a lava Shard between Explodes to get embers . refresh Blaze if it ran out .\nif you ever run out of embers while Fired Up! unlucky i guess blame rng and cast a few flare bolts to get 1 ember and back to spamming explode\n\nAfter Fired Up! expire reapply all your dots and spam Flare Bolt untill you reach 5 ember stacks then spam explode until you reach 0 ember stacks . keep an eye out for Fired Up! because you need to have 5 ember stacks when it comes off cooldown.\n\n\nif there are more than 1 target use Flames Of Neltharion instead of explode\n\n[stats]\ncrit and haste can make your Fired Up! last longer which means more dps . so i guess\n\n\nHit Rating until cap-> Spell Power -> Crit -> Haste -> Int -> Spirit\n\n[tips]\nbasically 95% of your damage comes when you have Fired Up! active so use your trinkets and Eruption Only while its active .",
